# Scene 77's ladder (fixtures/ladder77: the sweep's save of scene 77,
# Twinsen put in Tippet's secret passage before the ladder, SceneStartX,
# Y, Z 28938 1536 3800, facing it, and the CD's LBA.CFG). Up walks him
# to the ladder and up it. Its zone 6 ends at Z 3588 in LBA.EXE and at
# 3616 in LbaWin, so that the climb starts at 3614, where LBA.EXE's
# starts at 3587.

hold 0.1
sleep 70
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot start
down Up
sleep 5
up Up
sleep 3
shot end
